  "published": "2026-06-18T08:28:34.207Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added typed byte[] binary field support to the read and write mappers, so an\n            [OdooField] property typed as byte[]/byte[]? maps to and from an Odoo base64 binary\n            field (for example image_1920).\n            Added a typed IOdooAttachmentClient for working with ir.attachment: UploadAsync,\n            batch UploadManyAsync, DownloadAsync, DownloadManyAsync, DownloadForRecordAsync,\n            GetMetadataAsync, GetMetadataManyAsync, ListForRecordAsync, ReplaceContentAsync,\n            DeleteAsync, and DeleteManyAsync.\n            Added ergonomic upload helpers: UploadFileAsync/UploadFilesAsync upload straight from a\n            file path, and OdooAttachmentUploadRequest.FromFile/FromBytes build a request with the\n            MIME type resolved from the file name.\n            Added typed link overloads (UploadAsync<TLinkedModel> and\n            ListForRecordAsync<TLinkedModel>) that resolve res_model from a model type's\n            [OdooModel] attribute.\n            Files are transferred as base64 over the existing JSON-2 transport, requiring no new\n            transport or authentication.",
